  "pitch": "Goanna/UXP browser keeping XUL add-ons, revived by new maintainers.",
  "summary": "A UXP reference browser started by the Pale Moon author, abandoned in 2021 and revived by community developers in 2022. Keeps XUL add-ons, runs on Windows 7+ and Linux, and is still described as beta.",
